    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d506">

                <pb facs="0568" n="552" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg552"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2531/7–2247: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-22T10:00:00-04:00">July 22, 1947—10
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>595. Dunn saw Vergara yesterday on renewal provisional commercial agreement.
                    Vergara said Chile willing insert reaffirmation clause along lines desired by
                    Department (Deptel 322, July 1<anchor n="83"
                        xml:id="d506-f1"/>) provided <pb facs="0569" n="553" xml:id="pg553"/>
                    clearly understood that negotiations on treaty friendship would be on basis
                    other than our proposed draft which he said unacceptable on political and
                    psychological grounds and which Foreign Office considers too all-embracing with
                    many points therein already covered in constitution and laws. Chilean Treaty
                    Commission scheduled inform Embassy today of decision on draft of provisional
                    agreement proposed by Embassy. Will cable draft soon as possible.<anchor n="84"
                        xml:id="d506-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d506-f1" n="83" xml:id="d506-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d506-f2" n="84" xml:id="d506-f2-content">
                <p>The exchange of notes renewing the 1945 Provisional Commercial Agreement between
                    Chile and the United States took place on July 30 and 31, 1947. For text, see
                    TIAS No. 1642.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
